---
description: Service worker / app-shell caching rules
globs: ["public/sw.js", "next.config.*", "app/manifest*"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Cache-first for the app shell only. Dexie already owns the data cache —
  this worker never touches API responses.
- New dependency (e.g. next-pwa) needs the reason + rejected hand-rolled
  alternative stated — Section 0's rule applies here too.
